        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sleepless in Seattle\n- People: Nora Ephron, Jeff Arch, Tom Hanks, Meg Ryan, Bill Pullman, Ross Malinger, Rob Reiner, Rosie O'Donnell, Gaby Hoffmann, Victor Garber, Rita Wilson, Roseann O'Donnell\n- Topics: Film credits, cast, biography\n\nFacts:\n- Roseann O'Donnell was born on March 21, 1962.\n- Roseann O'Donnell is an American comedian, actress, author, and television personality.\n- Sleepless in Seattle is a 1993 American romantic comedy-drama film.\n- Nora Ephron directed and co-wrote Sleepless in Seattle.\n- Jeff Arch wrote the story on which Sleepless in Seattle is based.\n- Sleepless in Seattle stars Tom Hanks and Meg Ryan.\n- Sleepless in Seattle has a supporting cast that includes Bill Pullman, Ross Malinger, Rob Reiner, Rosie O'Donnell, Gaby Hoffmann, Victor Garber, and Rita Wilson.",
